test('intentWindow 초기61초lock대기는상위승인기한이남아도새receipt/consume/READY0으로거절한다',async()=>{const f=await intentFixture({approvalWindowMs:120000});try{f.delay.stage='LOCK';f.delay.ms=61000;intentError(await f.post(f.command),412,'RESOURCE_UNVERIFIED');assert.equal(f.delay.hits,1);noIntentWrites(f);assert.deepEqual(f.unexpected,[]);}finally{await f.close();}});
for(const stage of ['RECEIPT','INTENT'])test('intentWindow '+stage+'61초지연뒤상위승인은유효해도원60초deadline실패로전부rollback한다',async()=>{const f=await intentFixture({approvalWindowMs:120000});try{f.delay.stage=stage;f.delay.ms=61000;intentError(await f.post(f.command),412,'RESOURCE_UNVERIFIED');assert.equal(f.delay.hits,1);assert.equal(f.rollbacks(),1);noIntentWrites(f);assert.deepEqual(f.unexpected,[]);}finally{await f.close();}});
test('intentWindow 만료뒤같은원command replay는역사INTENT_READY만반환하고새사용/소비0이다',async()=>{const f=await intentFixture({approvalWindowMs:120000});try{const original=intentOk(await f.post(f.command));f.clock(new Date(Date.parse(f.at)+61000).toISOString());assert.deepEqual(intentOk(await f.post(f.command)),original);for(const table of Object.values(f.tables))assert.equal(table.length,1);assert.equal(f.io(),0);assert.deepEqual(f.unexpected,[]);}finally{await f.close();}});

// 실 FailureLimiter의 별도 pool transaction 경계. 기존 counter 모델의 release no-op에 기대지 않는다.
async function limiterReleaseFixture(){const m=await api('store','InstallationResourceFailureLimiter'),f=counterFixture(),limiter=new m.InstallationResourceFailureLimiter(f.access),ticket=await limiter.admit('t'.repeat(43),pid,keyId);const pool:any=f.access.pool,original=pool.connect.bind(pool),raw=await original();let current:any=null,sequence=0,rollbackFails=false;const releases:unknown[]=[],connections:number[]=[],rollbackError=Object.assign(Error('synthetic-limiter-rollback-unknown'),{code:'ECONNRESET'});let commitError:unknown;
 pool.connect=async()=>{if(!current||current.destroyed){const own:any={id:++sequence,destroyed:false,async query(sql:string,args:any[]=[]){if(sql==='ROLLBACK'&&rollbackFails)throw rollbackError;try{return await raw.query(sql,args);}catch(e){if(sql==='COMMIT')commitError=e;throw e;}},release(error?:unknown){releases.push(error);if(error instanceof Error)own.destroyed=true;}};current=own;}connections.push(current.id);return current;};
 return{f,limiter,ticket,releases,connections,rollbackError,commitError:()=>commitError,rollbackFail:()=>{rollbackFails=true;},peekClient:async()=>{await pool.connect();return connections.at(-1);}};
}
test('realLimiter 정상기록/ACK의두pooltransaction은정상반환하고연결재사용을유지한다',async()=>{const x=await limiterReleaseFixture();await x.limiter.recordFailure(x.ticket);assert.deepEqual(x.releases,[undefined,undefined]);assert.equal(x.connections[0],x.connections[1]);assert.deepEqual(x.f.unexpected,[]);});
test('realLimiter 본문실패뒤확정rollback은정상반환을유지하고counter추가0이다',async()=>{const x=await limiterReleaseFixture();x.f.storageFail();await assert.rejects(x.limiter.recordFailure(x.ticket),exact('RESOURCE_STATE_UNKNOWN',503));assert.deepEqual(x.releases,[undefined]);assert.equal(x.connections[0],await x.peekClient());assert.equal(x.f.buckets.size,0);assert.deepEqual(x.f.unexpected,[]);});
test('realLimiter rollback실패는실release(error)로불명연결을폐기해야한다',async()=>{const x=await limiterReleaseFixture();x.f.storageFail();x.rollbackFail();await assert.rejects(x.limiter.recordFailure(x.ticket),exact('RESOURCE_STATE_UNKNOWN',503));assert.strictEqual(x.releases[0],x.rollbackError);assert.notEqual(x.connections[0],await x.peekClient());assert.deepEqual(x.f.unexpected,[]);});
for(const point of ['before','after'] as const)test('realLimiter COMMIT '+point+'응답불명도별도pool연결을error로폐기해야한다',async()=>{const x=await limiterReleaseFixture();x.f.loseCommit(point);await assert.rejects(x.limiter.recordFailure(x.ticket),exact('RESOURCE_STATE_UNKNOWN',503));assert(x.commitError() instanceof Error);assert.strictEqual(x.releases[0],x.commitError());assert.notEqual(x.connections[0],await x.peekClient());assert.deepEqual(x.f.unexpected,[]);});

import {ProjectApprovals as FulfillApprovalClass} from '../../../apps/server/modules/approvals/project-approvals.ts';
const targetPost=(f:Awaited<ReturnType<typeof intentFixture>>,ref:any,app=f.app)=>app.inject({method:'POST',url:'/api/v1/projects/'+f.command.projectId+'/backup-resource-intents/'+ref.id+'/fulfill',headers:{host:'localhost:3830',cookie:'__Host-anvil.sid='+intentToken,origin:intentOrigin,'x-anvil-csrf':intentCsrf},payload:{intentRef:ref,secretInput:null}});
const targetGet=(f:Awaited<ReturnType<typeof intentFixture>>,suffix:string,app=f.app)=>app.inject({method:'GET',url:'/api/v1/projects/'+f.command.projectId+suffix,headers:{host:'localhost:3830',cookie:'__Host-anvil.sid='+intentToken}});
function targetView(response:any,ref:any,state:string){assert.equal(response.statusCode,200,response.body);const v=response.json();assert.deepEqual(Object.keys(v).sort(),['intentRef','action','resourceRef','state','expiresAt','resultRef','reasonCodes'].sort());assert.deepEqual(v.intentRef,ref);assert.equal(v.action,'REGISTER_TARGET');assert.equal(v.resourceRef,null);assert.equal(v.state,state);assert(Array.isArray(v.reasonCodes));assert(!JSON.stringify(v).includes('/synthetic/'));return v;}
async function waitForProbe(f:Awaited<ReturnType<typeof intentFixture>>,running:Promise<any>){f.probe.entered??=new Promise<void>(resolve=>{f.probe.markEntered=resolve;});const first=await Promise.race([f.probe.entered.then(()=>({kind:'PROBE',body:''})),running.then(r=>({kind:'EARLY',body:r.body}))]);assert.equal(first.kind,'PROBE',first.body);}
function armProbe(f:Awaited<ReturnType<typeof intentFixture>>){f.probe.paused=true;f.probe.entered=new Promise<void>(resolve=>{f.probe.markEntered=resolve;});}

test('targetFulfill 원CONSUMED의durableclaim뒤probe하고descriptor/R2목록·고정조회까지연결한다',async()=>{const f=await intentFixture();const originalAuthorize=FulfillApprovalClass.prototype.authorize,originalConsume=FulfillApprovalClass.prototype.consume;let authorizeCalls=0,consumeCalls=0;try{const ref=intentOk(await f.post(f.command)).data.intentRef;const sourceResult=structuredClone(f.tables.commands[0].result_ref);FulfillApprovalClass.prototype.authorize=async()=>{authorizeCalls++;throw Error('FULFILL_REAUTHORIZE_FORBIDDEN');};FulfillApprovalClass.prototype.consume=async()=>{consumeCalls++;throw Error('FULFILL_RECONSUME_FORBIDDEN');};const done=targetView(await targetPost(f,ref),ref,'SUCCEEDED');assert.equal(authorizeCalls,0);assert.equal(consumeCalls,0);assert(done.resultRef&&done.resultRef.version===1);assert.equal(f.tables.commands.length,1);assert.equal(f.tables.receipts.length,1);assert.equal(f.tables.audits.length,1);assert.equal(f.tables.consumptions.length,1);assert.deepEqual(f.tables.commands[0].result_ref,sourceResult,'원INTENT_READY receipt불변');assert.equal(f.resources.heads.length,1);assert.equal(f.resources.versions.length,1);assert(f.resources.events.length>=1);const descriptor=f.resources.versions[0];assert.equal(descriptor.origin_intent_id,ref.id);assert.equal(descriptor.command_id,f.tables.commands[0].id);assert.equal(descriptor.content_hash,done.resultRef.contentHash);assert(descriptor.snapshot_json);assert.equal(intentHash(descriptor.snapshot_json),done.resultRef.contentHash);assert.equal(descriptor.snapshot_json.kind,'TARGET');assert.equal(descriptor.snapshot_json.displayName,f.payload.displayName);assert.deepEqual(f.probe.trace.filter(v=>v==='CREATE'),['CREATE']);for(const event of ['ROOT','SYNC','READ','STAT','REMOVE','PARENT_SYNC'])assert(f.probe.trace.includes(event),event);assert.equal(f.probe.files.size,0);const read=targetView(await targetGet(f,'/backup-resource-intents/'+ref.id),ref,'SUCCEEDED');assert.deepEqual(read.resultRef,done.resultRef);const listResponse=await targetGet(f,'/backup-resources?kind=TARGET&limit=50');assert.equal(listResponse.statusCode,200,listResponse.body);const list=listResponse.json();assert.equal(list.state,'CONFIGURED');assert.equal(list.page.items.length,1);const item=list.page.items[0];assert.deepEqual(item.ref,done.resultRef);assert.equal(item.kind,'TARGET');assert.equal(item.displayName,f.payload.displayName);assert.equal(item.current.eligible,true);assert.deepEqual(item.current.reasonCodes,[]);assert.match(item.providerProfileRef.contentHash,/^[a-f0-9]{64}$/);assert.match(item.protectionEvidenceRef.contentHash,/^[a-f0-9]{64}$/);const fixed=await targetGet(f,'/backup-resources/'+done.resultRef.id+'/versions/1');assert.equal(fixed.statusCode,200,fixed.body);assert.deepEqual(fixed.json().ref,done.resultRef);assert.equal(fixed.json().current.eligible,true);assert(!JSON.stringify([list,fixed.json()]).includes('/synthetic/'));const counts={commands:f.tables.commands.length,receipts:f.tables.receipts.length,audits:f.tables.audits.length,consumed:f.tables.consumptions.length,heads:f.resources.heads.length,versions:f.resources.versions.length,events:f.resources.events.length,probe:f.probe.trace.length};assert.deepEqual(targetView(await targetPost(f,ref),ref,'SUCCEEDED'),done);assert.deepEqual({commands:f.tables.commands.length,receipts:f.tables.receipts.length,audits:f.tables.audits.length,consumed:f.tables.consumptions.length,heads:f.resources.heads.length,versions:f.resources.versions.length,events:f.resources.events.length,probe:f.probe.trace.length},counts,'동일fulfill 재제출의probe/descriptor/event/승인추가0');assert.deepEqual(f.unexpected,[]);}finally{FulfillApprovalClass.prototype.authorize=originalAuthorize;FulfillApprovalClass.prototype.consume=originalConsume;await f.close();}});

test('targetFulfill 동시재제출은실PROCESSING을보고409이며원probe는단1회다',{timeout:5000},async()=>{const f=await intentFixture();let running:Promise<any>|undefined;try{const ref=intentOk(await f.post(f.command)).data.intentRef;armProbe(f);running=targetPost(f,ref);await waitForProbe(f,running);assert.equal(f.tables.intents[0].state,'PROCESSING');assert.equal(f.probe.trace.filter(v=>v==='CREATE').length,1);intentError(await targetPost(f,ref),409,'RESOURCE_PROCESSING');assert.equal(f.probe.trace.filter(v=>v==='CREATE').length,1);f.probe.release!();targetView(await running,ref,'SUCCEEDED');assert.equal(f.resources.versions.length,1);assert.equal(f.tables.consumptions.length,1);}finally{f.probe.release?.();if(running)await running.catch(()=>{});await f.close();}});

test('targetFulfill 원command/consumedreceipt 단독변조는claim·probe전에503으로닫힌다',async()=>{for(const field of ['commandHash','receiptDigest','consumptionDigest']){const f=await intentFixture();try{const ref=intentOk(await f.post(f.command)).data.intentRef;if(field==='commandHash')f.tables.commands[0].request_hash='0'.repeat(64);if(field==='receiptDigest')f.tables.receipts[0].scope_digest='0'.repeat(64);if(field==='consumptionDigest')f.tables.consumptions[0].scope_digest='0'.repeat(64);intentError(await targetPost(f,ref),503,'RESOURCE_STATE_UNKNOWN');assert.equal(f.io(),0);assert.equal(f.probe.trace.length,0);assert.equal(f.resources.versions.length,0);assert.equal(f.tables.consumptions.length,1);assert.deepEqual(f.unexpected,[]);}finally{await f.close();}}});

test('targetFulfill probe뒤최종control/원최단기한변경은descriptor성공0·같은intent재실행0이다',async()=>{for(const change of ['control','expiry']){const f=await intentFixture();try{const ref=intentOk(await f.post(f.command)).data.intentRef;f.probe.afterProbe=()=>{if(change==='control')f.current.generation=2;else f.clock(new Date(Date.parse(f.at)+46000).toISOString());};intentError(await targetPost(f,ref),change==='control'?409:412,change==='control'?'CONTROL_GENERATION_CONFLICT':'RESOURCE_UNVERIFIED');assert.equal(f.probe.trace.filter(v=>v==='CREATE').length,1);assert.equal(f.resources.versions.length,0);assert.notEqual(f.tables.intents[0].state,'READY');assert.notEqual(f.tables.intents[0].state,'SUCCEEDED');const count=f.probe.trace.length;await targetPost(f,ref);assert.equal(f.probe.trace.length,count);assert.equal(f.tables.consumptions.length,1);assert.deepEqual(f.unexpected,[]);}finally{await f.close();}}});

test('targetFulfill root보호/실readback불일치는단순verified true로성공시키지않는다',async()=>{for(const bad of ['mode','readback']){const f=await intentFixture();try{const ref=intentOk(await f.post(f.command)).data.intentRef;if(bad==='mode')f.probe.rootMode='755';else f.probe.readMismatch=true;intentError(await targetPost(f,ref),412,'RESOURCE_UNVERIFIED');assert(f.probe.trace.includes('ROOT'));if(bad==='mode')assert.equal(f.probe.trace.includes('CREATE'),false);else assert(f.probe.trace.includes('READ'));assert.equal(f.resources.versions.length,0);assert.notEqual(f.tables.intents[0].state,'READY');assert.equal(f.tables.consumptions.length,1);}finally{await f.close();}}});

test('targetFulfill probe뒤DB저장/COMMIT응답불명은UNKNOWN·자료보존·GET만허용하고자동복구0이다',async()=>{for(const fault of ['RESOURCE','RESOURCE_COMMIT_AFTER']){const f=await intentFixture();try{const ref=intentOk(await f.post(f.command)).data.intentRef;f.fault.mode=fault;intentError(await targetPost(f,ref),503,'RESOURCE_STATE_UNKNOWN');assert.equal(f.fault.hits,1,'실제fault도달');assert.equal(f.probe.trace.filter(v=>v==='CREATE').length,1);assert.equal(f.tables.intents[0].state,'UNKNOWN');if(fault==='RESOURCE_COMMIT_AFTER')assert.equal(f.resources.versions.length,1,'성공했을수있는descriptor삭제0');else assert.equal(f.resources.versions.length,0);f.fault.mode='';const before=f.probe.trace.length;const view=targetView(await targetGet(f,'/backup-resource-intents/'+ref.id),ref,'UNKNOWN');assert.equal(view.resultRef,null);intentError(await targetPost(f,ref),503,'RESOURCE_STATE_UNKNOWN');assert.equal(f.probe.trace.length,before);assert.equal(f.tables.intents[0].state,'UNKNOWN');assert.equal(f.tables.consumptions.length,1);assert.deepEqual(f.unexpected,[]);}finally{await f.close();}}});

test('targetFulfill cold인스턴스는이전PROCESSING을UNKNOWN으로조회하고probe를재개하지않는다',{timeout:5000},async()=>{const f=await intentFixture();let running:Promise<any>|undefined,cold:ReturnType<typeof buildApp>|undefined;try{const ref=intentOk(await f.post(f.command)).data.intentRef;armProbe(f);running=targetPost(f,ref);await waitForProbe(f,running);assert.equal(f.tables.intents[0].state,'PROCESSING');cold=buildApp({},undefined,{repository:f.access,origin:intentOrigin});const before=f.probe.trace.length;targetView(await targetGet(f,'/backup-resource-intents/'+ref.id,cold),ref,'UNKNOWN');intentError(await targetPost(f,ref,cold),503,'RESOURCE_STATE_UNKNOWN');assert.equal(f.probe.trace.length,before);assert.equal(f.tables.intents[0].state,'UNKNOWN');f.probe.release!();intentError(await running,503,'RESOURCE_STATE_UNKNOWN');targetView(await targetGet(f,'/backup-resource-intents/'+ref.id,cold),ref,'UNKNOWN');assert.equal(f.tables.intents[0].state,'UNKNOWN');assert.equal(f.resources.versions.length,0,'늦은옛claim이descriptor성공으로UNKNOWN을덮지못한다');assert.equal(f.tables.consumptions.length,1);assert.deepEqual(f.unexpected,[]);}finally{f.probe.release?.();if(running)await running.catch(()=>{});if(cold)await cold.close();await f.close();}});

for(const mode of ['query','csrf','connector','body-limit'] as const)test('targetBoundary '+mode+'는claim/probe0·no-store로닫힌다',async()=>{const f=await intentFixture();try{const ref=intentOk(await f.post(f.command)).data.intentRef,headers:Record<string,string>={host:'localhost:3830',cookie:'__Host-anvil.sid='+intentToken,origin:intentOrigin,'x-anvil-csrf':intentCsrf};if(mode==='csrf')delete headers['x-anvil-csrf'];if(mode==='connector')headers.authorization='Bearer av3ct1_'+'t'.repeat(43);const payload=mode==='body-limit'?{intentRef:ref,secretInput:null,padding:'x'.repeat(21000)}:{intentRef:ref,secretInput:null};const r=await f.app.inject({method:'POST',url:'/api/v1/projects/'+pid+'/backup-resource-intents/'+ref.id+'/fulfill'+(mode==='query'?'?extra=1':''),headers,payload});const wanted={query:[400,'INPUT_INVALID'],csrf:[403,'CSRF_INVALID'],connector:[403,'CONNECTOR_CREDENTIAL_SCOPE_DENIED'],'body-limit':[413,'PAYLOAD_TOO_LARGE']} as const;intentError(r,wanted[mode][0],wanted[mode][1]);assert.equal(r.headers['cache-control'],'no-store');assert.equal(f.probe.trace.length,0);assert.equal(f.tables.intents[0].state,'READY');assert.equal(f.resources.versions.length,0);assert.deepEqual(f.unexpected,[]);}finally{await f.close();}});

